<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak Jan-April trade deficit SKK 27.908 bln.</title>
<headline>Slovak Jan-April trade deficit SKK 27.908 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovakia's trade deficit for the first four months of 1997 was 27.908 billion crowns, compared to a 21.498 billion shortfall for the same period in 1996, the statistical bureau (SUSR) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p> SLOVAK FOREIGN TRADE JAN-APR 1997   Q1 1997   JAN-APR 1996</p>
<p>  Imports		    123.178	85.411	103.104</p>
<p>  Exports		     95.270	69.517	 81.606</p>
<p>  Balance		    -27.908     -15.894	-21.498</p>
<p>Note. All figures, which are in billions of Slovak crowns, are preliminary and subject to revision.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
